CEL Conformance Test Data
=========================

The `*.textproto` files in this directory are verbatim copies of the
Common Expression Language conformance test corpus from:

    Repository: https://github.com/google/cel-spec
    Path:       tests/simple/testdata/
    Commit:     see UPSTREAM.sha for the exact pinned commit
    License:    Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)

The original files are Copyright the CEL authors.  They are
redistributed here unmodified for use as a reference test suite for
arcel, the CEL evaluator implementation under sample/arcel/.

Re-fetching
-----------

`fetch.rb` in this directory pulls a fresh copy via the GitHub
contents API and updates UPSTREAM.sha.  Run it after a `git pull` of
cel-spec when the upstream conformance suite changes.

The arcel sources (parser, evaluator, harness) are independent of
these test fixtures and were written from scratch against the CEL
language specification.
